# Override the repo-wide *.tar.gz -> Git LFS routing for this directory.
#
# This session's network egress does not permit reaching lfs.github.com
# (only github.com itself), so packages placed here are committed as
# plain git blobs instead. They are small (tens of KB, source-only
# archives) -- nowhere near the size class .gitattributes' LFS rules
# exist to keep out of regular history. If that changes, remove this
# override and push via a machine with LFS network access instead.
*.tar.gz -filter -diff -merge -text
*.zip    -filter -diff -merge -text
